p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖助措施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营营员</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>我所将按照一定标准</span><span><span>报销营员来程路费</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>以及</span><span><span>拟录取推免生的返程路费</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>在所研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>    我所研究生在学期间实行奖助学金制度，根据攻读学位和科研课题的不同：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span><span><strong><span>博士生</span></strong></span><strong><span>的奖助学金为</span><span><span>5500元/月以上</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>硕士生</span></strong></span><strong><span>的奖助学金为</span><span><span>3500-4000元/月</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>（不含学业奖学金）</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>另有全覆盖的学业奖学金</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>硕士生</span><span><span>平均8000元/年</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>博士生</span><span><span>平均13000元/年</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>我所同时设立</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>高额的企业奖学金、国家奖学金等</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>开学后还有机会申请丰厚的青苗奖学金</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>10万元、5万元、2万元</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCic79vPTNj5xWSxa5rkuyh2AQvAAkzxp7GrrF87ztic6qUQypBWhjokCDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名时间及方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicTjqE0OAj8g6oxGDQviauO2LyMqY0jap58oXwoCBl6DJWdJH6wr8yM8Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>2025年</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>5月8日~6月18日</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>组委会将根据提供的电子材料进行筛选，入围的同学再准备相关纸质版材料</span></strong></span><strong><span>（签字、盖章）即可</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicTjqE0OAj8g6oxGDQviauO2LyMqY0jap58oXwoCBl6DJWdJH6wr8yM8Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>方式一：报名通道链接</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/OlEGbAd.aspx</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>（浏览器复制上方链接快速报名）</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>方式二：“扫码”报名</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicKLHVInRC0JMq9Jrx8iabIG2zsCc1YeZnA7Yn1HVIVPia1KE9U8h31nCQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>（扫描上方二维码进入报名通道）</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicTjqE0OAj8g6oxGDQviauO2LyMqY0jap58oXwoCBl6DJWdJH6wr8yM8Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>材料提交</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>    完成报名的同学须提前准备“</span><span><span>大连化物所2025年夏令营申请个人信息表</span></span><span>”电子版（附件获取，暂时无需打印、签字或盖章），</span><span><span>发送时间及方式请关注后续通知</span></span><span>。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>    表单均以“学校全称-学院全称-专业全称-姓名”命名</span></span><span>，如：大连理工大学-化工学院-化学工程与工艺-刘恒</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Q0sdKctC7Sm9MF1M-y3Ikg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件：大连化物所2025年夏令营申请个人信息表</span></a></span></section><section><p><span>（点击上方链接获取报名表）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCic79vPTNj5xWSxa5rkuyh2AQvAAkzxp7GrrF87ztic6qUQypBWhjokCDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系我们</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究生部</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>官方网站</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>http://www.gsc.dicp.ac.cn</span></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>后续招生通知将在5月下旬发布</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>敬请期待</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>官方微信公众号</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>后续夏令营相关重要通知将在我所</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>研究生部微信公众号上发布</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>提前关注，不错过重要信息</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>杨老师</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>0411-84379457</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>yanghua@dicp.ac.cn</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>吴老师</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>0411-84379011</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>yqwu@dicp.ac.cn</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>QQ交流群</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>群1：142993376</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>群2：785986279</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCic6SUmF28BdDwq3bH4nq1B8mVc0C2hAPWMQtj5gCz07Ejmowr6bcatFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><b><span>研究所简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>    中国科学院大连化学物理研究所</span></span></strong><span><span>（以下简称“大连化物所”）创建于1949年3月，是一个基础研究与应用研究并重、应用研究和技术转化相结合，以任务带学科为主要特色的综合性研究所。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>    七十多年来，大连化物所通过不断积累和调整，逐步形成了自己的科研特色。1998年，大连化物所成为中国科学院知识创新工程首批试点单位之一；2007年经国家批准筹建洁净能源国家实验室；2010年8月，大连化物所在“创新2020”发展战略研讨会中将所发展战略修订为“发挥学科综合优势，加强技术集成创新，以可持续发展的能源研究为主导，坚持资源环境优化、生物技术和先进材料创新协调发展，在国民经济和国家安全中发挥不可替代的作用，创建世界一流研究所”。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicO6zYyJopbYtbF3Cll72RmYMSLts0EmUSMWQfh4oIpEEyGQlRicKXKOw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>以国家目标为使命</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>创造了多项国内外第一</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCic16bORMumxMRe3ibc83PJvbO4fia651F7mKuXsxzZBYicUSibgXy7txQGibw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>科技创新人才队伍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>    目前，在所工作</span><span><span>两院院士12人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>国家特支计划入选者33人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>创新人才推进计划入选者23人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>国家杰出青年基金获得者32人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>国家优秀青年基金获得者27人</span></span><span>。大连化物所具有博士生导师、硕士生导师资格审批权，现有</span><span><span>博士生导师208人</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>硕士生导师230人</span></span><span>。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCicSuFhekiaC3yRYf59752VHkPq6tPhPRicRGz0zMzFoJ1oVpicew4iarN1pg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科分布&amp;就业情况</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>    大连化物所是国务院学位委员会授权培养博士、硕士学位的单位，具有</span><span><span>物理学、化学、材料科学与工程和化学工程与技术四个一级学科博士学位授予权</span></span><span>。拥有</span><span><span>全国重点实验室2+3（参与）个</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>国家工程中心5个</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>基础科学研究中心4+3（参与）项</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>院级实验室5个</span></span><span>。设</span><span><span>博士后流动站2个</span></span><span>，在站博士后325人。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>    截至2024年底，在所研究生1629人（含联合培养533人，含留学生36人），其中博士生951人，硕士生663人，已培养研究生3891名，其中博士2787名，硕士1104名。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/a2qGgyAkpIdC67IM0cLBWneqfKHncDCic7sExsmOvmaYHZeCXB6DmSKO4f2nLEAkAdlMP7uibcgicwFESQuXDm6Ew/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>    大连化物所毕业生就业前景良好，</span><span><span>2018-2024年就业率均为100%</span></span><span>，</span><s